{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04127","headline":"拟古三首 一 · 徐彦伯","name":"拟古三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遥裔烟屿鸿，双影旦夕同。\n交翰倚沙月，和鸣弄江风。\n𦶜若茂芳序，君子从远戎\n云生阴海没，花落春潭空。\n红泪掩促柱，锦衾罗薰笼。\n自伤琼草绿，讵惜铅粉红。\n裂帛附双燕，爲予向辽东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}